# Secret of Bloodbending, cast on turn 3 with Black Lotus and Mox Sapphire for {U}{U}{U}{U}: "You control target opponent during their next combat
# phase" (CR 723.1). Bot2's Memnite, cast on turn 2, is ready to attack on turn 4, and the control waits (NextTurnControlledBy, "+combat") until
# then. The combat phase is the whole phase: Bot1 controls Bot2 from the beginning
# of combat step to its end, through the attack, and Bot2 is its own again for the second main phase. The spell is exiled as its last instruction.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Secret of Bloodbending
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Secret of Bloodbending.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Secret of Bloodbending
? Bot2.NextTurnControlledBy = Bot1+combat
? Bot2.ControlledBy = (absent)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.ControlledBy = (absent)
? Bot2.NextTurnControlledBy = Bot1+combat
[T4 Bot2.BeginCombat]
? Bot2.ControlledBy = Bot1
? Bot2.NextTurnControlledBy = (absent)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
? Bot2.ControlledBy = Bot1
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.EndCombat]
? Bot2.ControlledBy = Bot1
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.ControlledBy = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Exile = Secret of Bloodbending
